ew release list! Seriously. Most of the time there\\u2019s nothing new or good to watch. I might occasionally like a foreign film, but this is the United States and I want to see good American movies that have been in the theater and that are updated on a regular basis. You should have filters that keep from showing us unwanted content. Add tags for countries, tags for ratings, and age groups etc. The stream also freezes and don\\u2019t let anyone say it\\u2019s your internet connection because I have the top package, and Prime Video still works every time Netflix freezes. Netflix says it\\u2019s having trouble showing this selection or something like that, try again later, in the middle of a movie, or right at the ending\\u2026 Then there is your policy of only one device. I understand you don\\u2019t want people sharing their account, but multiple devices on the same account should be allowed in one household. I am not sharing my account, I just want to be able to go from room to room without issues. And lastly there are no replies to any of these reviews. That is product review 101 if you care about retaining your customers.\",\n          \"I do love the app but it has to be uninstalled and redownloaded regularly. Even with updates it freezes up frequently but when it's working it's great.\",\n          \"The movies and show that are Netflix originals are often lame and boring, with most of the storylines making now sense, and also there is more political movies and shows then their used to be, now I know to get the \\u201cwoke\\u201d audiences to watch you need to make them more \\u201cwoke\\u201d but trust me more people will watch the movies if you take most of that away, see how the views you got on Netflix original movies went down around 2020 this is because this is when the world went \\u201cwoke\\u201d and you can see what effect that has had on Disney you wouldn\\u2019t want other companies trying to buy you out right? So make the movies and shows less \\u201cwoke and \\u201cpolitical\\u201d and try to think of better storylines for the movies, also the political effects on shows are warping the minds of children, and making the parents have a harder time raising them, so taking out the politics in the movies and shows would not only make them more interesting, it would also make it easier on parents, which would, overall, make you more money.\"\n        ],\n        \"semantic_type\": \"\",\n        \"description\": \"\"\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"column\": \"score\",\n      \"properties\": {\n        \"dtype\": \"number\",\n        \"std\": 1.436181412051861,\n        \"min\": 1.0,\n        \"max\": 5.0,\n        \"num_unique_values\": 5,\n        \"samples\": [\n          1.0,\n          5.0,\n          4.0\n        ],\n        \"semantic_type\": \"\",\n        \"description\": \"\"\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"column\": \"datetime\",\n      \"properties\": {\n        \"dtype\": \"date\",\n        \"min\": \"2017-09-19 01:25:15\",\n        \"max\": \"2025-02-26 02:47:34\",\n        \"num_unique_values\": 7980,\n        \"samples\": [\n          \"2025-01-26 02:11:07\",\n          \"2025-02-05 17:14:08\",\n          \"2020-08-25 00:27:42\"\n        ],\n        \"semantic_type\": \"\",\n        \"description\": \"\"\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"column\": \"company\",\n      \"properties\": {\n        \"dtype\": \"category\",\n        \"num_unique_values\": 3,\n        \"samples\": [\n          \"Netflix\",\n          \"Prime\",\n          \"Hulu\"\n        ],\n        \"semantic_type\": \"\",\n        \"description\": \"\"\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"column\": \"data_source\",\n      \"properties\": {\n        \"dtype\": \"category\",\n        \"num_unique_values\": 2,\n        \"samples\": [\n          \"Apple App Store\",\n          \"Google Play\"\n        ],\n        \"semantic_type\": \"\",\n        \"description\": \"\"\n      }\n    }\n  ]\n}"}},"metadata":{},"execution_count":30}]},{"cell